{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>OUTSIDERS - Demo</strong> is a work-in-progress Third-person shooter that blends Survival Horror with intense cooperative gameplay, designed <strong>exclusively for two players</strong>.<br> In the demo, you and your friend wake up in a cabin, disoriented and with no memory of what happened. To survive, you must team up, use your unique skills to uncover the island\u2019s dark secrets, solve challenging puzzles, and face its corrupted, hostile inhabitants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>What to expect in the OUTSIDERS demo:</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unique Characters</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">She is a military-trained sharpshooter, boasting impeccable aim and precision, but her lack of physical strength makes close combat risky.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">He is swift and strong, excelling in melee combat and capable of brutally dismembering enemies. However, his skills with firearms are limited.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Combat</strong><br>Face two distinct enemy types as you navigate through the demo\u2019s environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368930/extras/Combate.gif?t=1734570636\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Puzzles</strong><br>Work together with your friend to solve puzzles and progress through the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368930/extras/Puzzle2.gif?t=1734570636\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Horror</strong><br>Beware! Danger lurks in every corner. Each step could bring a terrifying surprise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asse